Define the macro square taking value:
    value times value
End macro.
Define the macro twice taking first:
    Substitute square with first done plus Substitute square with first done
End macro.
Define the macro report taking label and value:
    Say stringize label.
    Say value.
End macro.
Define the macro variable_named taking prefix and suffix:
    paste prefix and suffix
End macro.
Say Substitute square with 7 done.
Say Substitute twice with 3 done.
Expand report with total 12 done.
Declare paste_demo_one as integer with value 5.
Say Substitute variable_named with paste_demo_ one done.
Define the macro answer:
    42
End macro.
Say Substitute answer done.
Say Substitute square with (2 plus 3) done.
Undefine the macro answer.
